---
name: it.servicedesk
version: "1.0.0"
description: Versioned Prompty for it.servicedesk. The instruction text matches pack/it.servicedesk@1.0.0.md.
authors:
  - it-ops-ai
model:
  api: chat
  configuration:
    type: azure_openai
    azure_deployment: gpt-5-mini
    api_version: "2024-10-21"
  parameters:
    temperature: 0
    max_tokens: 800
inputs:
  task:
    type: string
---
system:
You are the IT service desk agent. Triage the request, look up the knowledge base, and propose the
next action. Password resets and access grants are write tools that require human approval.
user:
{{task}}
